### 建立報名
# @name createReq
POST http://localhost:3001/api/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "新同學",
  "email": "new@example.com",
  "phone": "0911222333"
}

### 更新剛剛那筆（phone 或 status）
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/signup/{{createReq.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "0911000111"
}

### 取得清單
GET http://localhost:3001/api/signup

### 刪除剛剛那筆
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/signup/{{createReq.response.body.id}}

### 刪除後再看一次清單
GET http://localhost:3001/api/signup

### 再用同一個 email 報名（應該要 400 + 友善錯誤）
POST {{createReq.response.body.id}}/api/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "新同學2",
  "email": "new@example.com",
  "phone": "0999888777"
}

### 分頁測試：第 1 頁、每頁 3 筆
GET {{createReq.response.body.id}}/api/signup?page=1&limit=3

### 分頁測試：第 2 頁、每頁 3 筆
GET {{createReq.response.body.id}}/api/signup?page=2&limit=3
